<section id="familiar" style="padding:clamp(70px,8vw,124px) clamp(20px,4vw,40px);border-top:1px solid #ECEDEE;background:#FAFAF9">
<div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto">
<div data-reveal style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A8C91">01 — The problem you know</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:clamp(24px,4vw,64px);margin-top:24px;align-items:start">
<h2 data-reveal style="margin:0;font-size:clamp(34px,4.4vw,62px);line-height:1.0;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-weight:500">Your body is tired. Your mind hasn't noticed.</h2>
<p data-reveal style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#55565A;max-width:500px">The day ends, but the momentum doesn't. You are not lazy and you are not broken — Singapore is one of the most sleep-deprived places in the world, and the way we live makes winding down genuinely hard.</p>
</div>
<div style="margin-top:clamp(32px,4vw,56px);border-bottom:1px solid #ECEDEE">
<div data-reveal style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(110px,1fr));gap:6px 32px;padding:20px 2px;border-top:1px solid #ECEDEE;align-items:baseline"><div style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#8A8C91">11:54 PM</div><p style="margin:0;grid-column:span 2;min-width:260px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-.015em">You promised yourself an early night. You are still scrolling.</p></div>
<div data-reveal style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(110px,1fr));gap:6px 32px;padding:20px 2px;border-top:1px solid #ECEDEE;align-items:baseline"><div style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#8A8C91">2:07 AM</div><p style="margin:0;grid-column:span 2;min-width:260px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-.015em">Your mind replays tomorrow's meeting, then starts the maths on how many hours are left.</p></div>
<div data-reveal style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(110px,1fr));gap:6px 32px;padding:20px 2px;border-top:1px solid #ECEDEE;align-items:baseline"><div style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#8A8C91">6:30 AM</div><p style="margin:0;grid-column:span 2;min-width:260px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-.015em">The alarm wins again. You start the day already behind on rest.</p></div>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:1px;margin-top:16px;background:#E6E7E9;border:1px solid #E6E7E9;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden">
<div data-reveal style="background:#fff;padding:24px 22px 28px"><div style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.03em"><span data-count="56" data-suffix="%">56%</span></div><p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#55565A">Of adults here sleep less than seven hours a night. The highest rate of 17 markets surveyed.</p></div>
<div data-reveal style="background:#fff;padding:24px 22px 28px"><div style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.03em"><span data-count="6.4" data-decimals="1" data-suffix="h">6.4h</span></div><p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#55565A">The average Singapore night, against the seven to nine hours a body is built for.</p></div>
</div>
<p data-reveal style="margin:14px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#8A8C91">Sources: YouGov Global Sleep Study, 2024 (17 markets surveyed); Singapore average nightly sleep duration, published market research.</p>
<h3 data-reveal style="margin:clamp(40px,5vw,64px) 0 0;font-size:clamp(24px,2.6vw,34px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:500">Sleep debt doesn't forgive. It compounds.</h3>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:1px;margin-top:24px;background:#E6E7E9;border:1px solid #E6E7E9;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden">
<div data-reveal style="background:#fff;padding:24px 22px 28px"><div style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A8C91">Tonight</div><p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#55565A">Reactions slow, cravings climb and patience thins. You will not notice. Everyone around you will.</p></div>
<div data-reveal style="background:#fff;padding:24px 22px 28px"><div style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A8C91">This week</div><p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#55565A">Memory dips, blood pressure sits higher, and the waste your brain clears at night backs up.</p></div>
<div data-reveal style="background:#fff;padding:24px 22px 28px"><div style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A8C91">This month</div><p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#55565A">Immunity weakens, anxiety sits higher and skin recovers more slowly.</p></div>
<div data-reveal style="background:#fff;padding:24px 22px 28px"><div style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A8C91">Six months on</div><p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#55565A">Research links chronic short sleep to up to three times the heart-disease risk, a 57% higher type-2 diabetes risk and roughly double the risk of depression.</p></div>
</div>
<p data-reveal style="margin:28px 0 0;max-width:620px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#55565A">Rest responds quickly. Better sleep can start tonight.</p>
</div></section>